Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 16:56:55 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix: connect available room peers with explicit recipients
 and shared context

A stopped member no longer blocks new messages to ready peers. Explicit sends bind current room tools and carry self/recipient identities without replaying old deliveries. Cover subset validation and durable peer reply correlation; verified native Codex and DeepSeek exchange and cross-review, plus Enter submission in the desktop app.
